WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:10.344
- This is the most concentrated

00:00:10.344 --> 00:00:12.422
I've been in a 
classroom my entire life.

00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:15.261
(rap music)

00:00:29.382 --> 00:00:30.573
- [Gary] I have nothing to say.

00:00:30.573 --> 00:00:34.201
I'll let the visual speak but
people complaining about dumb

00:00:34.201 --> 00:00:37.594
shit, gets compounded 
when you get different context.

00:00:37.594 --> 00:00:40.587
I wish all of you perspective.

00:00:40.587 --> 00:00:44.060
That's me as a student. 
(group laughter)

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:46.046
That was me as a student.

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:48.643
This one, right here.

00:00:48.643 --> 00:00:49.675
That's how I rolled.

00:00:49.675 --> 00:00:53.207
Eight, little 
nine little Indians.

00:00:53.207 --> 00:00:56.765
(class singing)

00:00:57.717 --> 00:00:58.410
- [Teacher and 
Gary] Four little,

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:01.335
three little, 
two little Indians.

00:01:01.335 --> 00:01:04.637
One little Indian more.

00:01:06.756 --> 00:01:09.991
(class singing)

00:01:17.078 --> 00:01:20.289
("Sleeper" by Ronak)

00:01:22.642 --> 00:01:24.783
- [Man] What can I say, Gary?

00:01:24.783 --> 00:01:26.962
And what can I say, Michael?

00:01:26.962 --> 00:01:29.506
We are overjoyed to 
have you here again.

00:01:29.506 --> 00:01:33.070
Anytime I see you come here,
I ask myself don't you have

00:01:33.070 --> 00:01:34.475
anything to do?

00:01:34.475 --> 00:01:37.049
Don't you have 
anything to do with your money?

00:01:37.049 --> 00:01:38.625
Sometimes I keep telling them

00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:40.642
it's not because 
you have so much.

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:43.312
It's because of 
compassion for somebody else.

00:01:43.312 --> 00:01:46.356
Let me remind you that you have
built more school building in

00:01:46.356 --> 00:01:48.092
Adaklu more than government.
That is a fact.

00:01:48.092 --> 00:01:50.652
You have built more 
school buildings in Adaklu

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:51.361
even than government.

00:01:51.361 --> 00:01:52.988
Nobody have built more than you.

00:01:52.988 --> 00:01:55.498
We have the tech 
team one on site.

00:01:55.498 --> 00:01:57.868
And we are pleading 
for even extra three.

00:01:57.868 --> 00:02:01.110
I want to give you an assurance
never ever think that whatever

00:02:01.110 --> 00:02:04.207
you have done here is 
just for the sake of it.

00:02:04.207 --> 00:02:09.378
Believe me, you are sowing the
seed for the new generation that

00:02:09.378 --> 00:02:12.924
in other ways would've had no
choice and no chance of any

00:02:12.924 --> 00:02:13.967
chance in life.

00:02:13.967 --> 00:02:14.952
- But that's my 
man, right there.

00:02:14.952 --> 00:02:18.628
That's how I used to roll.

00:02:18.628 --> 00:02:20.164
That's exactly right. 
(DRock laughs)

00:02:20.164 --> 00:02:23.278
Anti-establishment. My man.

00:02:24.315 --> 00:02:27.230
- [Man] But today, what you have
added to what Adaklu have done

00:02:27.230 --> 00:02:30.691
have given the opportunity to
all these young ones to

00:02:30.691 --> 00:02:32.386
have a shot at life.

00:02:32.386 --> 00:02:36.526
Because in this world without
education your chances are

00:02:36.526 --> 00:02:40.081
almost zero of 
becoming anything.

00:02:45.946 --> 00:02:47.375
- Just perspective, man.

00:02:47.375 --> 00:02:49.419
It's just perspective.

00:02:49.419 --> 00:02:51.444
- [Man 2] It is 
also a short story.

00:02:51.444 --> 00:02:53.177
I wanted to read this out loud.

00:02:53.177 --> 00:02:55.586
Do you understand?
- Yes.

00:02:55.586 --> 00:02:57.563
- [Man 2] Okay, that's good.
- [Gary] Okay.

00:02:57.563 --> 00:03:02.314
(Gary speaking in 
another language)

00:03:24.567 --> 00:03:25.971
- [Man] We have 
learned a lot from you.

00:03:25.971 --> 00:03:27.835
A common spirit.

00:03:27.835 --> 00:03:32.076
It is important that people in
this community also played a

00:03:32.076 --> 00:03:33.658
role in building this.

00:03:35.229 --> 00:03:36.389
- [Gary] Uh-huh.

00:03:36.389 --> 00:03:38.206
Okay, okay.

00:03:38.206 --> 00:03:40.230
Alright, let's go!

00:03:40.230 --> 00:03:41.239
I eat this shit for breakfast.

00:03:41.239 --> 00:03:42.824
I would do this 
eighteen hours a day.

00:03:42.824 --> 00:03:46.151
Being dead serious.

00:03:49.343 --> 00:03:51.079
- [Man] You didn't 
just ask them,

00:03:51.079 --> 00:03:54.150
you contribute your money and
folded your hands between your

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.572
legs and then 
delivered a school building.

00:03:56.572 --> 00:04:00.003
They sweated as 
part of that for vision.

00:04:08.092 --> 00:04:09.999
- [Gary] Pickin' 
up the pace, DRock.

00:04:09.999 --> 00:04:11.495
That's how I do it.
I finish strong.

00:04:11.495 --> 00:04:16.187
I think the working with 
the dirt was no question

00:04:16.187 --> 00:04:17.806
I think my favorite 
part of the whole trip.

00:04:17.806 --> 00:04:20.497
I genuinely think we were on the

00:04:20.497 --> 00:04:24.248
high side of enthusiasm 
of work as a group.

00:04:24.248 --> 00:04:27.809
("Sleeper" by Ronak)

00:04:32.687 --> 00:04:35.372
- [Man] None of our 
program run beyond four months.

00:04:35.372 --> 00:04:37.700
It's almost always 
within that period of time.

00:04:37.700 --> 00:04:40.547
Government projects would
have taken a year-plus and the

00:04:40.547 --> 00:04:43.607
quality wouldn't 
have been any better.

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:53.068
- [Children] Gary, Gary, Gary!

00:04:53.068 --> 00:04:55.169
Gary, Gary, Gary!

00:05:00.818 --> 00:05:02.422
- [Gary] One life, baby. 
One life.

00:05:02.422 --> 00:05:05.129
- One life.
- [Gary] One life.

00:05:07.339 --> 00:05:08.655
- One life!
- [Gary] One life.

00:05:08.655 --> 00:05:10.766
One. One.

00:05:11.785 --> 00:05:14.925
- [Man] With (inaudible) 
saying that yes the roads

00:05:14.925 --> 00:05:16.883
in Adaklu are no good.

00:05:16.883 --> 00:05:17.731
We don't have water,

00:05:17.731 --> 00:05:20.212
in fact we don't have any
potable drinking water here.

00:05:20.212 --> 00:05:22.039
We don't have any 
health facility if

00:05:22.039 --> 00:05:23.448
anybody gets sick now.

00:05:23.448 --> 00:05:25.975
We have to travel 
seven miles or so to get

00:05:25.975 --> 00:05:27.353
to the nearest health center.

00:05:27.353 --> 00:05:30.121
But education is the 
bedrock of everything.

00:05:30.121 --> 00:05:33.405
- [Boy] I am a student of
Adaklu Avelebe Primary School.

00:05:33.405 --> 00:05:36.784
The title of my poem 
is "Where Is Your Legacy?"

00:05:36.784 --> 00:05:38.768
What do you want 
to be remembered for?

00:05:38.768 --> 00:05:40.417
- [Man] It is 
people that build roads.

00:05:40.417 --> 00:05:45.089
It is people that drill well
holes so where we give education

00:05:45.089 --> 00:05:48.574
to our people we are giving them
the key to doing the rest of the

00:05:48.574 --> 00:05:50.457
things which is 
the health care,

00:05:50.457 --> 00:05:51.922
which is the 
road and everything.

00:05:51.922 --> 00:05:54.132
- [Boy] Do you want to be 
remembered as a caring and

00:05:54.132 --> 00:05:55.435
responsible parent?

00:05:55.435 --> 00:05:58.196
Do you want to be remembered 
as a committed teacher?

00:05:58.196 --> 00:06:00.744
Do you want to be remembered
as a hard working student?

00:06:00.744 --> 00:06:03.387
Or do you want to be remembered
as a patriotic citizen?

00:06:03.387 --> 00:06:05.613
What and how do you 
want to be remembered for?

00:06:05.613 --> 00:06:08.266
- [Man] Want to show you that
you are not wasting your time.

00:06:08.266 --> 00:06:09.983
You are not 
wasting your investment.

00:06:09.983 --> 00:06:12.238
This is the best use of 
your money and your time.

00:06:12.238 --> 00:06:16.008
And I believe that other people
the people who sponsor you

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:17.173
should understand.

00:06:17.173 --> 00:06:20.481
A little boy from Adaklu
saying that was sowing so much

00:06:20.481 --> 00:06:21.437
seed in Adaklu.

00:06:21.437 --> 00:06:25.941
But what a joy to know that what
you have done together with me,

00:06:25.941 --> 00:06:28.957
with together with all these
people and the community a child

00:06:28.957 --> 00:06:31.435
can do better 
than me in the future.

00:06:31.435 --> 00:06:32.945
That is all that is necessary.

00:06:34.923 --> 00:06:37.618
(crowd cheers and applause)

00:06:40.339 --> 00:06:44.667
- [Group] Hooray!
Hooray!

00:06:44.667 --> 00:06:47.141
- I want to thank you very 
much and say to everybody

00:06:47.141 --> 00:06:49.570
education has no replacement.

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:53.153
We can not use education as
an alternative to anything.

00:06:53.153 --> 00:06:55.094
That is the only 
choice we have in Adaklu.

00:06:57.408 --> 00:07:00.072
(audience applause)

00:07:00.658 --> 00:07:02.137
- One life.

00:07:02.137 --> 00:07:03.500
What an amazing experience.

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:07.931
(group singing "Don't You Worry
Child" by Swedish House Mafia)

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:30.842
- [Gary] Michael, 
this section's for you.

00:07:30.842 --> 00:07:33.985
Sorry, Brandon.
Sorry, Brandon.

00:07:33.985 --> 00:07:35.244
Sorry man.

00:07:35.244 --> 00:07:38.369
